        <div><a name="sec-contamination" id="sec-contamination"></a><h2>5.3<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Contamination</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_edb2c3b3-a625-03cb-6b2c-06143d544913" id="_edb2c3b3-a625-03cb-6b2c-06143d544913"></a><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><u><b>IHO Definition</b> :</u> IA_PLG describes the degree of contamination (aerial coverage) in thirds based on the Russian national 3-point scale.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_39e5a80f-e8d9-7ce9-b8fc-ec6559c63049" id="_39e5a80f-e8d9-7ce9-b8fc-ec6559c63049"></a><u><b>Attribute Type :</b></u> enumeration</p>

<div class="ol_wrap" style="page-break-after:auto"><p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_c1424370-dc88-f014-5c7b-5925fe5fc967" id="_c1424370-dc88-f014-5c7b-5925fe5fc967"></a>01<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :No or insignificant Contamination
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo4;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_6220fb77-f118-7967-5d4f-bd03e85cae7c" id="_6220fb77-f118-7967-5d4f-bd03e85cae7c"></a>10<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :&lt;1/3 of area
</p>
