</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo8;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_5eb3835f-2eff-d854-15b9-60cb119c55a7" id="_5eb3835f-2eff-d854-15b9-60cb119c55a7"></a>90<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Small and Medium Floes Only
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo8;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_66c7e329-85e7-4368-f35c-eda51b41d0ce" id="_66c7e329-85e7-4368-f35c-eda51b41d0ce"></a>92<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Small Floes Only
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo8;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_b9e6b779-f9ef-fd56-e655-0455719b97b6" id="_b9e6b779-f9ef-fd56-e655-0455719b97b6"></a>98<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :No Fractures
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo8;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_0819528e-f397-9dc1-736a-bff34dd16d36" id="_0819528e-f397-9dc1-736a-bff34dd16d36"></a>99<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Undetermined/Unknown
</p>
</div>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="sec-frequencyofLeadsorFractures" id="sec-frequencyofLeadsorFractures"></a><h2>5.8<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Frequency of Leads or Fractures</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_65e2c975-2635-5bed-6429-ddfa5f177d77" id="_65e2c975-2635-5bed-6429-ddfa5f177d77"></a><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><u><b>IHO Definition</b> :</u> ICERFQ indicates the frequency of leads or fractures in number per nautical mile.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_bf41c1bb-8718-7317-68a0-7900cc717dd9" id="_bf41c1bb-8718-7317-68a0-7900cc717dd9"></a><u><b>Attribute Type :</b></u> integer</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="sec-hillsConcentration" id="sec-hillsConcentration"></a><h2>5.9<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Hills Concentration</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_3e351b7f-3387-3c57-6e20-d2060ea9d05d" id="_3e351b7f-3387-3c57-6e20-d2060ea9d05d"></a><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><u><b>IHO Definition</b> :</u> IA_HLG describes the degree of hilling in an ice area (usually multi-year ice).</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e05255b3-04a0-d0d6-0a15-019a88d3281a" id="_e05255b3-04a0-d0d6-0a15-019a88d3281a"></a><u><b>Attribute Type :</b></u> enumeration</p>

<div class="ol_wrap" style="page-break-after:auto"><p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_427afcfc-0a79-6b12-c28c-f1ce1de8c219" id="_427afcfc-0a79-6b12-c28c-f1ce1de8c219"></a>01<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Few hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_9ed817c0-a1de-c659-1052-f14d3fa9bb1c" id="_9ed817c0-a1de-c659-1052-f14d3fa9bb1c"></a>10<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Slight concentration of hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_bdd246d0-4876-8787-27d8-d8f3a6f57a1d" id="_bdd246d0-4876-8787-27d8-d8f3a6f57a1d"></a>12<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Slight to moderate concentration of hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_50fca519-c1d0-4230-1f84-42aaea402ba6" id="_50fca519-c1d0-4230-1f84-42aaea402ba6"></a>20<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Moderate concentration of hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_b20a64df-7af1-b981-a593-a1b7e57fb27f" id="_b20a64df-7af1-b981-a593-a1b7e57fb27f"></a>23<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Moderate to heavy concentration of hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_8ac4b382-fe22-c613-7ae3-0a73208a009f" id="_8ac4b382-fe22-c613-7ae3-0a73208a009f"></a>30<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Heavy concentration of hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_25123c43-e1ab-d5a6-e2b4-b79695a8639b" id="_25123c43-e1ab-d5a6-e2b4-b79695a8639b"></a>98<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :No hills
</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo9;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast"><a name="_ab8d7735-4106-0f4b-01e4-0123c1466a47" id="_ab8d7735-4106-0f4b-01e4-0123c1466a47"></a>99<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Undetermined/Unknown
</p>
</div>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
</div>
        <div><a name="sec-iceAverageThickness2" id="sec-iceAverageThickness2"></a><h2>5.10<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Ice Average Thickness</h2>

