</div>
        <div><a name="sec-icebergSize" id="sec-icebergSize"></a><h2>5.11<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Iceberg Size</h2>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="MsoISOTable" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;border-spacing:0;border-width:1px;"><a name="_2997186a-823b-3613-1fdf-244f8ce29c77" id="_2997186a-823b-3613-1fdf-244f8ce29c77"></a><thead><tr><th valign="top" align="left" style="font-weight:bold;border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:avoid;"><u><b>IHO Definition</b> :</u> The &#x201C;Iceberg Size&#x201D; categorizes the size of an iceberg.</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7ea739de-d832-990c-4ed6-63202894e1d3" id="_7ea739de-d832-990c-4ed6-63202894e1d3"></a><u><b>Attribute Type :</b></u> enumeration</p>

<div class="ol_wrap" style="page-break-after:auto"><p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo10;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst"><a name="_edf830f7-b787-92f9-322d-e5779cabc370" id="_edf830f7-b787-92f9-322d-e5779cabc370"></a>01<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Growler (&lt;1m asl)
</p>
