</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo10;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_d79bd34c-ee06-148c-a7d8-0b75b56b2ef7" id="_d79bd34c-ee06-148c-a7d8-0b75b56b2ef7"></a>03<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Small Iceberg (5-15m asl; 15-60m length)
