</p>
<p style="mso-list:l2 level1 lfo10;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle"><a name="_e3e0e1b4-87bb-6f44-70d2-127a5010a419" id="_e3e0e1b4-87bb-6f44-70d2-127a5010a419"></a>05<br/> <u><b>IHO Definition</b></u> :Large Iceberg (46-75m asl; 121-200m length)
</p>
